    "finalName": "",
    "description": "<p><i>Reference Book:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Star_Wars_Saga_Edition_Galaxy_at_War\" title=\"Star Wars Saga Edition Galaxy at War\">Star Wars Saga Edition Galaxy at War</a></i></p><p><i>See also:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Feats\" title=\"Feats\">Feats</a></i></p><p>You can leap behind cover, even when caught out in the open.</p><p><b>Prerequisite:</b> <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Trained\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Trained\">Trained</a> in <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Jump\" title=\"Jump\">Jump</a></p><p><b>Effect:</b> Once per turn, as a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Reaction\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Reaction\">Reaction</a> to being targeted by a ranged attack, you can make a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Jump\" title=\"Jump\">Jump</a> check to <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Long_Jump\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Long Jump\">Long Jump</a>. If you land in a square that provides you with <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Cover\" title=\"Cover\">Cover</a> from your attacker, you gain the normal <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Cover\" title=\"Cover\">Cover</a> bonus against the attack, even if you didn't have <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Cover\" title=\"Cover\">Cover</a> at the time the attack was made. When you use this Feat, you always land <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Prone\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Prone\">Prone</a>.</p>",
